emscripten: error-checking mutexes.

Without -pthread, emscripten leaves _POSIX_THREADS undefined, but its libc
has the mutexes of a single thread, which the OCaml side expects
(unix_create_error_checking_mutex).

--- a/error_checking_mutex/src/error_checking_mutex_stubs.c
+++ b/error_checking_mutex/src/error_checking_mutex_stubs.c
@@
-#if defined(_POSIX_THREADS) && _POSIX_THREADS >= 200112L
+#if (defined(_POSIX_THREADS) && _POSIX_THREADS >= 200112L) || defined(__EMSCRIPTEN__)
 CAMLprim value unix_create_error_checking_mutex(value __unused v_unit)
